WEBVTT

00:13:29.079 --> 00:13:34.287
So being less identified with your ideas
is also associated, I think,

00:13:34.287 --> 00:13:39.621
with having many of them just discovering
that most of them are no good

00:13:39.954 --> 00:13:44.246
and trying to to do the best you
can with a few that are good.

00:13:44.996 --> 00:13:47.829
So it's seeing ideas as abundant
rather than scarce.

00:13:47.912 --> 00:13:49.829
That's what makes it easier
to stay detached.

00:13:49.829 --> 00:13:54.996
Yeah, yeah. I mean, I used to tell my
students ideas are a dime a dozen.

00:13:55.037 --> 00:13:57.871
I mean, don't overinvest
in your old ideas.

00:13:58.454 --> 00:14:03.496
And so I used to encourage
my students to give up.